  "description": "AI tools for MgSoftDev.KnowledgeHub, defined once and usable from an in-app chat (Microsoft.Extensions.AI) or an MCP server (MgSoftDev.KnowledgeHub.Mcp). Read tools answer only with what the current user may see, after templates are rendered. Authoring tools let an AI write documentation as drafts through the library, so sanitizing, the image pipeline and permissions all apply, and never publish. WASM-safe: this package does not reference the MCP SDK.",
